  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Terekeka Home System Solar Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Name: Terekeka Home System Solar Project.Location: Terekeka State.Summary: WADS Company Ltd is looking to install a stand alone solar power system which would be designed to carry a load of up to 205watts. The initial design is slated to provide electricity to 60 households with additional household added after the first year. They also plan to utilize portable water pumps and solar drier to improve economic activities such as fishing and agriculture in the area.</narrative>
  </description>
